{"c":[{"id":"6e639a4926698b7e","sum":"Memory markdown grants no authority (permissions, onItsOwn, clean runs stay in memory.sqlite; editing a skill file puts it back on Tab; fileDigest catches offline edits). vite's oxc rejects a raw U+2028/U+2029 in a regex literal: write the escape.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T204920Z-024f4219fb18c6cf","text":"Memory markdown grants no authority: permissions and a skill's onItsOwn, clean runs and hand-off stay in memory.sqlite; editing a skill's file puts it back on Tab, and SkillJson.fileDigest catches edits made while Caret was stopped.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T204920Z-0ba29fff62387456","text":"vite's oxc parser rejects a regex literal holding a raw U+2028/U+2029 (a line terminator); write the \\u2028 escape. An agent's Write tool can turn the escape into the raw character.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"e2ebd6c0099fdfde","sum":"Push v2/* to remote sam (SamGu-NRX/Caret); origin is the team hackathon repo. B25: Ask intents use INTENT_ROUTE (gpt-oss-120b), plans WRITER_ROUTE (qwen3.8); qwen3.8's Groq 200k tokens/day runs out in dev; gpt-oss strict json_schema can 400.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T210855Z-22a0908ac8155d26","text":"Push v2/* branches to the remote named sam (SamGu-NRX/Caret), where their PRs live. origin is the team hackathon repo (theodorexli/hackathon-2026-09-19); a bare 'git push origin' publishes there.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T211051Z-2bd567d78f578d5c","text":"B25: Ask intents go to INTENT_ROUTE (gpt-oss-120b), plan programs to WRITER_ROUTE (qwen3.8); qwen3.8's Groq 200k tokens/day ran out during dev runs, and gpt-oss strict json_schema can 400 'does not match the expected schema'.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
